Package: inti
Title: Tools and Statistical Procedures in Plant Science
Version: 0.7.5.9000
Description: Part of the 'inkaverse' project, 'inti' provides tools and
    statistical procedures for plant science and experimental design. It
    supports researchers in experiment planning and data collection
    ('tarpuy()'), data analysis and visualization ('yupana()'), and
    scientific writing ('scihub()').
